{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e02-scene-15",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "不要站队  (Never Take Sides in a Label Dispute)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "kaiwen": "凯文",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Back in Chun Yuqiao's office at Xingtian, Kaiwen checks on singer Li Mingji's booking while Yuqiao weighs why diva Xin Huimei suddenly agreed to join the semifinal. Listen to their conversation first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "老大，现在跟李铭基确定通告吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你说辛惠美怎么会答应来参加半决赛呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "她之前从来都不参加综艺节目。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "要不要换方案？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "不用，辛惠美能来，效果是最好的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "而且远业跟星天一直合作。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "但是解约的事，我们不要站队。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "为什么呀？她不是跟远业和解了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "先走着看看吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "还有，告诉杏子，李铭基是一个麻烦的人物。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "一定要小心安排，别让菜鸟接近李铭基。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "放心吧，咱们部门没有菜鸟。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Let's unpack what they say. Kaiwen starts by asking whether to lock in Li Mingji's schedule.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "老大，现在跟李铭基确定通告吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Boss, should we confirm the booking with Li Mingji now?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你说辛惠美怎么会答应来参加半决赛呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Why do you think Xin Huimei agreed to join the semifinal?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "她之前从来都不参加综艺节目。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'She never appeared on variety shows before.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "要不要换方案？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Should we change the plan?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "不用，辛惠美能来，效果是最好的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No need, if Xin Huimei can come, the result will be the best.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "而且远业跟星天一直合作。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Besides, Yuanye and Xingtian have always worked together.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "但是解约的事，我们不要站队。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'But on the contract dispute, we must not take sides.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "为什么呀？她不是跟远业和解了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Why is that? Did she not make peace with Yuanye already?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "先走着看看吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Let us wait and see how it goes first.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "还有，告诉杏子，李铭基是一个麻烦的人物。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Also, tell Xingzi that Li Mingji is a troublesome figure.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "一定要小心安排，别让菜鸟接近李铭基。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Arrange things carefully, and do not let a rookie near Li Mingji.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "放心吧，咱们部门没有菜鸟。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Rest assured, there are no rookies in our department.'",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "老大，现在跟李铭基确定通告吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你说辛惠美怎么会答应来参加半决赛呢？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "她之前从来都不参加综艺节目。",
      "gap": 0.5
