    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "不用，辛惠美能来，效果是最好的。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "而且远业跟星天一直合作。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "但是解约的事，我们不要站队。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "为什么呀？她不是跟远业和解了吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "先走着看看吧。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "还有，告诉杏子，李铭基是一个麻烦的人物。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "一定要小心安排，别让菜鸟接近李铭基。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "放心吧，咱们部门没有菜鸟。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Yuqiao senses hidden tension behind Xin Huimei's sudden appearance and warns his team to stay neutral while handling Li Mingji with care. You learned \"zhandui\" for taking sides, \"cainiao\" for a workplace rookie, and \"fangxin\" to tell someone not to worry. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "回头见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
